Z||000005||Leadfoot||06-06-2001||11:39 AM||||Well I have my 2.8 on a stand right now.  It will be about a couple of weeks till it's completely assembled. I'll try to take some pictures of it and post them before I drop it in.  The other day I stopped by the junk yard, but all they had were a handful of partially complete 2.5's. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Leadfoot||06-25-2001||06:19 PM||||Sorry for dragging this thing from the past but Firebug you can find engine wire routing picks in the Helms service manual under "engine electrical".  I bought the book finally and installed the wires the way they should have been.<P>||||reg||1
